{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dcb3c371adb6522849bdc1578ac71d69.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dcb3c371adb6522849bdc1578ac71d69.gif?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diecast\u00a0</strong>is a dice-rolling roguelike about pushing your luck, building wild combos, and chasing impossible scores across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/44cff301917c29b884d22c16985154a0.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/44cff301917c29b884d22c16985154a0.apng?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll and reroll your way to victory by crafting the perfect scoring hand</strong>. Use your winnings to buy powerful new dice with unique faces and abilities, unlock different scoring options, and collect strange items that bend the odds in your favor. Every run is a chance to discover a new strategy\u2014and tempt Lady Luck a little further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/be0dc2ca77c3c316071a7dd585e87a32.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/be0dc2ca77c3c316071a7dd585e87a32.apng?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against rule-breaking boss rounds that force you to adapt. Build your strategy around them, or come crashing down to Earth. Complete runs to unlock harder difficulties and earn new starting dice bags for use in the Challenge Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/532ed4cf7bc1a084bf7c3848da1724fa.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/532ed4cf7bc1a084bf7c3848da1724fa.apng?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new dice, items, and scoring hands by completing achievements, or unlock everything instantly with the press of a button (if that\u2019s how you like your roguelikes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/5eaa24b96c6b6c856df27fbf03788e24.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/5eaa24b96c6b6c856df27fbf03788e24.apng?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ dice</strong> with unique faces and abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three dozen scoring hands</strong> with distinct rules to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ items</strong> that alter the odds in your favor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for <strong>30-minute runs</strong> with infinite replayability  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your limits in <strong>Endless Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your hand in<strong>\u00a0Challenge Mode</strong>\u00a0using unique dice bags </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep strategy</strong> meets chaotic dice-rolling engine building</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2443590?t=1752260490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752260490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/e3c881c83a31b24cad731102ebb8394c1f91a4bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752260490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/e3c881c83a31b24cad731102ebb8394c1f91a4bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752260490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dcb3c371adb6522849bdc1578ac71d69.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dcb3c371adb6522849bdc1578ac71d69.gif?t=1752260490\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diecast\u00a0</strong>is a dice-rolling roguelike about pushing your luck, building wild combos, and chasing impossible scores across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/44cff301917c29b884d22c16985154a0.poster.avif?t=1752260490\" media=\"